- Server-side secret management
- No API keys in frontend bundles
- Input validation at every external API boundary
- Safe file processing
- File size and request limits
- Protection against path traversal
- Authorization for all sensitive operations
- Tenant isolation where applicable
- Prompt-injection resistance
- Model output validation
- Safe error messages
- Restricted logging of sensitive content
- Appropriate retention and deletion behavior
- Explicit disclosure of AI processing and external service use

Do not send confidential brand material to a third-party AI service without the configured and disclosed processing policy permitting it.

